## 7. Tasks and reference answers

> A reference answer is what lets the harness check "did the tutor hand over the
> answer?" exactly, instead of asking a model to guess.

{% if d.tasks %}
{% for t in d.tasks %}
### {{ t.id }}{% if t.title %} — {{ t.title }}{% endif %}

{% if t.prompt_file %}
